version 0.16.0
component led-indicator-0603

# An indicator LED in 0603, stated as a class: the colour it shows and the wavelength that colour
# was measured at. The colour is a class, not a quantity — there is no better green — so it is
# the `value` of this class and the wavelength says which bin the colour came from.

kind         generic
category     led
construction indicator
polarized    yes

symbol indicators:led
footprint chip:chip-0603
params
  value      string  required
  wavelength length  required

# The cathode and the anode are not interchangable: the LED only conducts one way round.
pins
  1  K  polarized
  2  A  polarized
